Resource    taf/rfrl/procedures/resources/robot/TestModels/Common.robot


*** Keywords ***
Start PUSCH Performance Test
    [Arguments]                                             &{kwargs}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting NR PUSCH Performance Test...

    webui.start_pusch_performance_test                      &{kwargs}

    webui.wait_for_performance_test_to_start                timeout=60
    Robot Log Result                                        NR PUSCH Performance Test has started.

Validate PUSCH Performance Tables Results
    [Documentation]
    ...  Validates results requirements mentioned in QC docs.
    ...  Parameters for result tables which should be validated:
    ...      Received bits, Unreceived bits, Defective bits, Received blocks, Unreceived blocks, Defective blocks
    [Arguments]                                             ${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${FRC_Index}
    ...                                                     ${ul_slots}

    @{params}=                                              performance_validator.create_list_of_table_parameters
    ...                                                     param_dict=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    FOR  ${param}  IN  @{params}
      table_validators.validate_cumulative_results_table   param_name=${param}
       ...                                                  partial_res=${WebUI_part_res_table}
       ...                                                  cumulative_res=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    END
    rssi_validator.verify_rssi_values                       partial_res=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    performance_validator.validate_pusch_blocks             partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     ul_slots=${ul_slots}
    performance_validator.validate_pusch_bits               partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${FRC_Index}

Start PRACH Performance Test
    [Arguments]                                             &{kwargs}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting NR PRACH Performance Test...

    webui.start_prach_performance_test                      &{kwargs}

    webui.wait_for_performance_test_to_start                timeout=60

    Robot Log Result                                        NR PRACH Performance Test has started.

Validate PRACH Performance Tables Results
    [Documentation]
    ...  Validates requirements of PRACH test module mentioned in QC docs.
    ...  Parameters for result tables which should be validated:
    ...     Detected counter, Missed counter, False counter, Idle period counter, No Pa Counter (or No PA Counter in
    ...     some sw releases), Wrong Pa counter (or Wrong PA Counter in some sw releases), Wrong timing counter
    [Arguments]                                             ${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     ${reception_slot}
    ...                                                     ${technology_type}
    ...                                                     ${scs}

    @{params}=                                              performance_validator.create_list_of_table_parameters
    ...                                                     param_dict=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}

    FOR  ${param}  IN  @{params}
       table_validators.validate_cumulative_results_table   param_name=${param}
       ...                                                  partial_res=${WebUI_part_res_table}
       ...                                                  cumulative_res=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    END
    performance_validator.validate_counter_sum              partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     technology_type=${technology_type}
    ...                                                     scs=${scs}
    performance_validator.validate_false_and_detected_counter
    ...                                                     partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     percentage=2
    performance_validator.validate_idle_period_counter      partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     reception_slot=${reception_slot}
    ...                                                     technology_type=${technology_type}
    ...                                                     scs=${scs}
    performance_validator.validate_missed_counter           partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}

Start PUCCH Performance Test
    [Documentation]  Starts PUCCH Test Module (parameters list depends to the version of TC).
    ...              Please refer QC for more details.
    [Arguments]                                             &{kwargs}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting NR PUCCH Performance Test...
    webui.start_pucch_performance_test                      &{kwargs}

    webui.wait_for_performance_test_to_start                timeout=60

    Robot Log Result                                        NR PUCCH Performance Test has started.

Validate PUCCH Performance Tables Results
    [Documentation]
    ...  Validates results requirements mentioned in QC docs.
    ...  Parameters for result tables which should be validated:
    ...      Detected counter, Missed counter, False counter, Idle period counter
    [Arguments]                                             ${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     ${test_format}
    ...                                                     ${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     ${reception_slot}
    ...                                                     ${technology_type}
    ...                                                     ${scs}
    ...                                                     ${num_payload_bit}=1
    ...                                                     ${number_of_pucch_symbol}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${version}=2

    @{params}=                                              performance_validator.create_list_of_table_parameters
    ...                                                     param_dict=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    FOR  ${param}  IN  @{params}
       table_validators.validate_cumulative_results_table   param_name=${param}
       ...                                                  partial_res=${WebUI_part_res_table}
       ...                                                  cumulative_res=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    END
    performance_validator.validate_counter_sum              partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     technology_type=${technology_type}
    ...                                                     scs=${scs}
    ...                                                     pucch_format=${test_format}
    ...                                                     num_payload_bit=${num_payload_bit}
    Run keyword if  ${version} != 3                         performance_validator.validate_false_and_detected_counter
    ...                                                     partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    Run keyword if  ${version} == 3                         performance_validator.validate_false_and_detected_counter_v3
    ...                                                     partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_format=${test_format}
    ...                                                     number_of_pucch_symbol=${number_of_pucch_symbol}
    ...                                                     expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     reception_slot=${reception_slot}
    performance_validator.validate_idle_period_counter      partial_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                     test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                     expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                     reception_slot=${reception_slot}
    ...                                                     technology_type=${technology_type}
    ...                                                     scs=${scs}
    ...                                                     test_format=${test_format}
    ...                                                     num_payload_bit=${num_payload_bit}

Stop Performance Test
    [Arguments]                                             ${timeout}
    run keywords                                            webui.stop_performance_test
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     webui.wait_for_performance_test_to_stop
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

Performance Test Teardown
    Run keywords                                            Run keyword and ignore error
    ...                                                     webui.stop_performance_test
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Run keyword and ignore error
    ...                                                     webui.wait_for_performance_test_to_stop
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Run keyword and ignore error  webui.refresh_page
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Run keyword and ignore error  Connections.Close Selenium Session

Check Unavailability Of Performance Test Module
    [Arguments]                                             ${nr_cell}
    ...                                                     ${FRC_Index}
    webui.refresh_page
    ${test_available}                                       webui.is_performance_test_available
    ...                                                     local_cell=NRCELL-${nr_cell}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${FRC_Index}
    should not be true                                      ${test_available}

Wait For Performance Test Results And Stop Test
    [Arguments]                                             ${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     ${measures}
    ...                                                     ${tdd}=${FALSE}
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=60
    tm_startup.wait_for_test_model_results                 interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     measures=${measures}
    Stop Performance Test                                   timeout=${timeout}
